The runtime Skill content follows package tag v0.38.1. The core trees at this
tag and the review anchor have 14 matching paths. Thirteen files have identical
Git blob IDs. Only references/commands.md differs. The review anchor adds four
Browser Use Cloud environment variables and a lifecycle note absent from the
published package, so the runtime copy uses the tag version of that file.

The Glassbox adaptation adds execution guidance for the Owner Shell and the
no-exec Browser Tool, uses Exa for ordinary search, and reserves DOM browsing
for rendered content or interaction. It removes the upstream WebMCP workflow,
MCP server and chat integration instructions, plugins, cloud and attached
browser paths, and bulk session closing guidance. The upstream
Apache-2.0 license is included in LICENSE.

The reference files remain the upstream v0.38.1 content. The Glassbox
availability limits in SKILL.md take precedence over any upstream feature
descriptions in those references.
